market value of $500 million.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:09.100
500 days after we launched it, and we sold
it in January of 2000.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.720
And then the third company was X-fire
which

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:15.110
is an instant messenger for PC video
gamers.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.000
It spread virally.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:24.330
We got to about three million users, two
years after launching.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.872
We sold it for a $100 million to

00:02:25.872 --> 00:02:28.594
MTV and now there's fifteen million users,
using it.

00:02:28.594 --> 00:02:32.595
And I'm now work on my fourth one, which I
could end up being, I want to be four and

00:02:32.595 --> 00:02:34.491
o but I couldn't be three and one because
we

00:02:34.491 --> 00:02:36.990
