00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.880
&gt;&gt; A long, long, time ago.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:46.280
&gt;&gt; Look.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.450
&gt;&gt; We have to get into numbers.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:51.830
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah, the rea, yeah, well, the
reason why, is, is sort of interesting to

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.371
