00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.570
&gt;&gt; Yes.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:02.040
&gt;&gt; But, so you were, you were actually a
leader

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.790
in that, others came after you, also
didn't do very well.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:05.992
