00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:12.036
winner in that whole space of ordering
food from home.

00:03:12.036 --> 00:03:13.690
&gt;&gt; If we'd started a different time.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:18.110
&gt;&gt; Well, you, you sold it for $13 million.

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:19.074
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:03:19.074 --> 00:03:20.966
&gt;&gt; Most of the other companies I know lost
money, right?

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:23.690
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] So win by default.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:24.672
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:03:24.672 --> 00:03:25.520
&gt;&gt; sure.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:31.440
So I decided I was going to stop aging at
